%% Sequence Diagram Template
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Client App
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant Svc as Core Service
    database DB as Primary Database
    
    Client->>GW: HTTP POST /login {email, password}
    activate GW
    GW->>Svc: Validate credentials
    activate Svc
    Svc->>DB: Query user records by email
    activate DB
    DB-->>Svc: Return user record & hash
    deactivate DB
    Svc-->>GW: Return validation success & JWT
    deactivate Svc
    GW-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK {token}
    deactivate GW
